        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WB178, 1-7/8 Inch Diameter Wall Door Bumper</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1-7/8 Inch Decorative Door Bumper can be used everywhere, from homes to schools to retail shopping malls. It will prevent damage from a door crashing into a wall. This decorative design round flush wall mounted door bumper  is made of solid brass and available in 8 great finishes. Easy to install with the included hardware. The rubber bumper is concave in the center to accept the locking push button of a door knob/lever, so it will not self lock. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WB178-specifications.gif?v=1704354673\" width=\"329\" height=\"156\" border=\"0\" atl=\"1-7/8\" Decorative Wall Mount Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana WB178 1-7/8 Inch Wall Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Housing Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/WB178.pdf?v=1691095377\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana WB178 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1-7/8 Inch Decorative Door Bumper",
                "description": "1-7/8 Inch Diameter Wall Door Bumper, Deltana WB178 - The 1-7/8 Inch Decorative Door Bumper can be used everywhere, from homes to schools to retail shopping malls. It will prevent damage from a door crashing into a wall. This decorative design round flush wall mounted door bumper  is made of solid brass and available in 8 great finishes. Easy to install with the included hardware. The rubber bumper is concave in the center to accept the locking push button of a door knob/lever, so it will not self lock. ",
